{"id":"score-conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0093","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:29:16.764042Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0093"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0093","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":4,"strategies":["Reflection of feelings","Affirmation and Reassurance","Affirmation and Reassurance","Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Reflection of feelings"],"note":"Turn 12 weakens otherwise attentive support by immediately probing his facial expression again after the person had already described his calmness and their distress, rather than allowing space for the listening they requested.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0101","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:29:32.660049Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0101"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0101","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Reflection of feelings","Question","Providing Suggestions","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"The helper took the food restriction seriously, but repetitive reflection openings in turns 2, 4, 6, and 10 made the empathy feel formulaic, while turn 4 crowded the response with two questions.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0107","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:29:44.577299Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0107"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0107","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turns 4 and 6 moved prematurely toward budgeting and seeking help before clarifying the work/pay uncertainty, while turns 2, 4, 6, and 8 repeated the same reflection-plus-offer formula rather than deepening the emotional support.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
