{"id":"score-conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0137","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:30:26.383098Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0137"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-current-esconv-validation-0137","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Reflection of feelings","Question","Providing Suggestions","Question","Question","Question"],"note":"Turn 6 shifted toward advice despite the user's preference to discuss feelings, and turn 10 disrupted that exploration with repeated suicide questions and a crisis resource before clarifying whether “disappear” meant withdrawal or self-harm.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
